@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #285879
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EAF4FA
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #E8F5EE
left to right direction
title Workspace State — responsibilities and evidence
actor "Desktop user" as User
component "wsctl CLI" as CLI
component "GNOME session coordinator\nOne lifecycle owner" as Coordinator
database "Operation context\nRecovery journal" as Operation
database "Versioned checkpoints\nLast good + history" as Checkpoints
component "Application providers\nTerminal · browser · editor\nFiles · social apps · VM" as Providers
component "Application companions\nNative application identity/content" as Companions
component "gnome-winctl\nNative identity and placement" as Placement
component "GNOME / Mutter" as Shell
component "Login HUD\nProgress and user actions" as HUD
component "Owned-system alerts\nExplicit source inventory" as Alerts
component "gc-profiled\nExternal task scheduling" as GC
User --> CLI
CLI --> Coordinator
Coordinator <--> Operation : scoped ownership
Coordinator <--> Checkpoints : preserve / publish
Coordinator --> Providers : bounded work
Providers <--> Companions : recover and prove
Providers --> Placement : intent + request token
Placement <--> Shell : apply / observe
Coordinator --> HUD : atomic progress
HUD --> Coordinator : scoped cancel / acknowledgement
Alerts --> HUD : incident report
GC --> HUD : read-only status
note bottom of Coordinator
Each worker carries boot, login generation,
operation ID, mode, attempt and deadline.
Cancellation withdraws authorization immediately;
recovery retains ownership until completion.
end note
note bottom of Placement
Accepted / waiting is not verified.
Deferred requests retain physical monitor intent.
end note
@enduml
